  "description": "The most scalable and customizable permission server on the market. Fix your slow or broken permission system with Google's proven \"Zanzibar\" approach. Supports ACL, RBAC, and more. Written in Go, cloud native, headless, API-first. Available as a service on Ory Network and for self-hosters.",
